  "question": {
    "text": "A solid horizontal surface is covered with a thin layer of oil. A rectangular block of mass <math><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></math> is at rest on this surface. An impulse of <math><mn>1.0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>s</mi></math> is applied to the block at time <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> so that it starts moving along the x-axis with a velocity <math><mi>v</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#964;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math> , where <math><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> is a constant and <math><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> . The displacement of the block, in meter, at <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#964;</mi></math> is __________. Take <math><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.37</mn></math>"
  },
